OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwaves spur efforts to find
OL,4,Adrought-resistant crops
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the long, hot dry summer which
OL,7,Fsaw many parts of England under drought
OL,8,Fconditions, researches say they are
OL,9,Flooking at coming up with crops for the
OL,10,Ffuture that can withstand such
OL,11,Fstressful weather conditions.
OL,13,FHarper Adams University in Shropshire
OL,14,Fis working with the University of
OL,15,FWarwick Crop Centre on the issue, as
OL,16,Fpart of the government-funded Vegetable
OL,17,FGenetic Improvement Network (VeGIN).
OL,19,FFor Jim Monaghan, Professor of Crop
OL,20,FScience: "We are growing crops in the
OL,21,Fmost challenging conditions for
OL,22,Fgenerations."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
