OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwaves spur efforts to find
OL,4,Adrought-resistant crops
OL,5,
OL,6,FJuly 2026 was the driest for England
OL,7,Fand Wales since records began and the
OL,8,FMet Office is warning that it is "very
OL,9,Flikely" that 2027 is the hottest year
OL,10,Fon record globally.
